From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] msvcrt: Implement details::_Context's constructors and _StackGuard::_GetCurrentInlineDepth.

details::_Context's constructor from a Context pointer and its default
constructor closure (no context), _Context::_Oversubscribe (the same
function as Context::Oversubscribe, still a FIXME), and
_StackGuard::_GetCurrentInlineDepth, a counter of the current thread's
context the _StackGuard objects in the headers count inline chores with.
msvcr110, msvcr120 (msvcr120_app forwards) and concrt140.
